      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Alerts overview**: every Grafana-managed alert rule (folder *Alerts*, one rule group per cluster, rules as code in `clusters/aauti-hub-as1-obs-gke/grafana/alerting/`). Lists show only alerts that need attention (firing, pending, no data, error). Expected today: Platform-prod *HPA at max replicas* for `aauti-marketplace` (memory-driven, pinned at 5/5). Email notifications are not set up yet, so this page and *Alerting \u2192 Alert rules* are the only places alerts show."
